      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__Error_1ga485d0d66221d07288509697271552968" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>const char *</type>
        <definition>const char * wc_GetErrorString</definition>
        <argsstring>(int error)</argsstring>
        <name>wc_GetErrorString</name>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>error</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>This function returns the error string for a particular error code. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>この関数は、特定のエラーコードのエラー文字列を返します。</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>string Returns the error string for an error code as a string literal.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>error</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>error code for which to get the string</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">char<sp/>*<sp/>errorMsg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>err<sp/>=<sp/>wc_some_function();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if(<sp/>err<sp/>!=<sp/>0)<sp/>{<sp/>//<sp/>error<sp/>occurred</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>errorMsg<sp/>=<sp/>wc_GetErrorString(err);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Error_1gaa4ea3747d756f1ff09bb202cc4d931a5" kindref="member">wc_ErrorString</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>string エラーコードのエラー文字列を文字列リテラルとして返します。 <emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">char<sp/>*<sp/>errorMsg;</highlight></codeline>
